  "request": {
    "spec": "Move date-derived values to a fiscal-year basis, where the fiscal year starts on 1 July. Return 'fiscalYear' as 'FY<YY>' derived from the business-day-adjusted registration date. This changes existing behaviour: the membership identifier's year segment must use the fiscal year, and tenure must be counted in elapsed fiscal years rather than 365-day windows.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nMove date-derived values to a fiscal-year basis, where the fiscal year starts on 1 July. Return 'fiscalYear' as 'FY<YY>' derived from the business-day-adjusted registration date. This changes existing behaviour: the membership identifier's year segment must use the fiscal year, and tenure must be counted in elapsed fiscal years rather than 365-day windows.\n"
  },
